# Security headers for the static site and dashboard (Netlify / Cloudflare Pages `_headers` syntax).
# Copied into dist/ by the build; `npm run check:dist` fails if dist/_headers is missing or if the
# script hash below no longer matches the inline theme script in index.html.
#
# script-src: 'self' plus the sha256 of the one inline script in index.html (the pre-paint theme
#   loader). Changing that script by even one character changes the hash: recompute it with
#   `node scripts/check-dist.mjs --print-hash` and paste it here.
# connect-src: 'self' plus the public API origin. OWNER: replace https://api.[your-domain] with the
#   real API origin (the same value as VITE_PROD_API_URL's origin and PUBLIC_API_URL). If the API is
#   proxied on this origin under /api and /v1, 'self' alone is enough and the second entry can go.
# font-src 'self': the typefaces are self-hosted (@fontsource), nothing is loaded from Google Fonts.
# script-src/frame-src https://challenges.cloudflare.com: the Cloudflare Turnstile widget on signup and
#   resend-verification. Its script loads only when the server reports a turnstileSiteKey.
# img-src https: tenants' project thumbnails and avatars are arbitrary https URLs.
# style-src 'unsafe-inline': index.html's first-paint <style> block and React style attributes.
/*
  Content-Security-Policy: default-src 'self'; script-src 'self' https://challenges.cloudflare.com 'sha256-D6YcsU0PTCM3EEMSMce1GOIPTprZBpflFyUCauqQqDQ='; style-src 'self' 'unsafe-inline'; img-src 'self' data: https:; font-src 'self'; frame-src https://challenges.cloudflare.com; connect-src 'self' https://api.[your-domain]; frame-ancestors 'none'; base-uri 'self'; form-action 'self'; object-src 'none'; upgrade-insecure-requests
  X-Frame-Options: DENY
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  Referrer-Policy: no-referrer
  Strict-Transport-Security: max-age=31536000; includeSubDomains
  Permissions-Policy: camera=(), microphone=(), geolocation=(), payment=()
  Cross-Origin-Opener-Policy: same-origin
